8. Law Number 1 of 2003 concerning Establishment of North Halmahera Regency, South Halmahera Regency, Sula Islands Regency, East Halmahera Regency and Tidore Islands in North Maluku Province (State Gazette of the Republic of Indonesia of 2003 Number 21, Supplement to the State Gazette Number 4264);
